<title>BELGIUM: Colruyt 1996/97 group net up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Colruyt 1996/97 group net up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net				   2.163 vs     1.932</p>
<p>    Cons net				    2.164 vs     1.934</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)		   172 vs	 150</p>
<p>    Turnover net of VAT		    68.446 vs    59.453</p>
<p>NOTE - Ets. Fr. Colruyt is Belgium's third-biggest retailer.</p>
</text>
